# Website build stack

This is a Vite + React + TypeScript app. Follow the 4-piece stack from the setup guide.

- Load the **ui-ux-pro-max** skill before any UI/UX design or implementation.
- Animate with Motion: `import { motion } from 'motion/react'`. Confirm `motion` is in `package.json` before writing animation code.
- Prefer adapting a section from https://motion.dev/motion-ui over inventing layout/animation from scratch. Keep the animation; restyle to the design system.
- Do not default to generic AI-slop layouts (purple gradients, Inter-only type, card grids with stock icons).
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. No emoji as icons.
